  "issue": 387,
  "request": "Goal: Enable senti setup to list official preset candidates from the default official preset remote when SENTI_OFFICIAL_PRESETS_REPO is not set. Scope: setup candidate discovery, official preset source resolution, and persistence behavior for base-only versus official preset selection. Out of Scope: changing the official preset repository contents or unrelated plugin workflow behavior. Description: Fresh interactive setup currently shows only base because setup reads only an env-provided local manifest. Reuse the default official source resolution so users can choose official presets without manual environment setup.",
